 "note": "Unit opener (UNIT IX BIOTECHNOLOGY); no running header, no header band, no printed folio. Two-column body inside a full-width peach panel (#ffe2be, y 0.342-0.654): left column = chapter list (Chapter 9 / Chapter 10 entries, one contents_panel element, no A2 block so n null; 'Chapter N' lines are bold); right column = the unit's introductory prose (block n=1, justified sans). body_text_size_px = cap height of 'E' in 'Ever' (20px). Title text 'UNIT IX' (size_rel 3.25) and 'BIOTECHNOLOGY' (3.95) are white on the dark-green banner (#4c7436); A2 has no block for them, so n null. The plain coloured stripes above and below (light green #92c83f, dark green #4c7436, teal #0b9b9b, orange #f7951d) are reported as decorative_image with their fills (not rule_bar, which the brief reserves for the chapter-opener divider, so the chapter palette is not polluted by unit-page stripes); the peach panel is reported as a box with n null. Decorative dancing-figure graphic at lower right is decorative_image. The 'Reprint 2026-27' stamp at the page foot (y~0.974) is not a folio and is left out. The faint diagonal 'not to be republished' watermark is ignored. Fills sampled as medians of flat interiors. size_pt not given (DPI not stated in input)."
